  "note_2026-11-05": "2026-11-05: the source moved from src/harness_autonomy/ to src/, and the package is now named clinical_agent; the files use LF line endings. Every model is called at OpenRouter with one API key, pinned to its own provider (openrouter_transport.py, moved into the package; openai_transport.py, claude_transport.py and the subscription modes removed; the model entries hold no prices, since the cost is the one OpenRouter reports), the arm original-corrected is in agent.ARMS, run.py has no --auth flag, and the FHIR container labels start with dev.clinical-agent. The prompts, tools, institutional entries, corrections, split, loop and scorer are unchanged. source_sha256_paper_runs is the digest that the config.json of every paper run records."
